Date: Mon, 10 Feb 2025 16:35:07 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1479/1695] core: psa-adac: remove unused files and directories

Remove the following directories and relative files, as they are not used:
- cmake,
- psa-crypto,
- target,
- template_hal_files,
- sdc-600.

